# Exclude oversized PNG originals from Vercel deploys.
# Most PNGs in /images/ have WebP siblings that are what actually
# gets rendered. The PNG originals (some 17-27 MB each) bloat the
# deploy bundle and are never requested by browsers.
#
# This file only affects what Vercel uploads at build time. Nothing
# below is removed from the git repo.

images/*.png

# Keep logo and favicon
!images/favicon.png
!images/athlos-logo.png

# Keep PNGs referenced inline in HTML (no WebP sibling used)
!images/ufs-family-new.png
!images/ufs-cephalo-2.png
!images/wios-sensor-docking-black.png
!images/wios-award-best-product.png
!images/wios-award-dps.png

# Keep DC-Air X-ray galleries (wios.html)
!images/wios-anterior-*.png
!images/wios-posterior-*.png
!images/wios-bw-*.png

# Keep Industrial IP67 X-ray example PNGs (ufs-ip67.html)
!images/Fish*.png
!images/TwoFish*.png
!images/ChickenFillet*.png
!images/Nuts*.png
!images/Walnuts*.png
!images/Chip*.png

# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Eleventy build artefacts and Node dependencies.
# On this feature branch, vercel.json runs `npx @11ty/eleventy`
# and serves _site/. So we INCLUDE src/, eleventy.config.js, and
# package*.json in the deploy upload (Vercel needs them to build),
# and only exclude node_modules/ (re-installed by Vercel) and
# _site/ (regenerated by Vercel's build).
# Production (main branch) has its own vercel.json with no build;
# this .vercelignore on that branch can stay as-is or be tightened
# back to exclude src/, but on the feature branch these stay
# included.
# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
_site/

# Test infrastructure — Vercel doesn't need these.
tests/
playwright.config.js
playwright-report/
test-results/
